572		<main id="main" tabindex="-1">
573			<section aria-label="Introduction">
574				<p>This is a well-structured, accessible HTML5 document demonstrating modern best practices for semantic markup and inclusive design.</p>
575				<p>
576					It uses semantic landmarks, a skip link for keyboard navigation,
577					and CSS that adapts to your light or dark mode preference.
578				</p>
579				<p>
580					Text and link colors meet WCAG AA contrast in both themes, type scales
581					with your browser's font size, and motion respects your system settings.
582				</p>
583			</section>
